<http://data.silknow.org/object/8a06d9e9-0d65-3341-88b2-85f7520f65ad>
        a                       ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment            "Middle East, Textile; Dress fabric of silk satin, Iran, 1800-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin.\n\nWoven silk, satin ground with twill binding.\nBrown ground with repeating pattern of a round fruit with a pair of leaves at the base and three sprouts at the top. Small dot of white in each fruit. Every motif slopes a little to the right.\nWarp: brown silk S-twist. Weft: brown silk indeterminable twist, pink [faded] silk indeterminable twist, white silk, indeterminable twist."@en ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note        "Middle East, Textile; Dress fabric of silk satin, Iran, 1800-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin.\n\nWoven silk, satin ground with twill binding.\nBrown ground with repeating pattern of a round fruit with a pair of leaves at the base and three sprouts at the top. Small dot of white in each fruit. Every motif slopes a little to the right.\nWarp: brown silk S-twist. Weft: brown silk indeterminable twist, pink [faded] silk indeterminable twist, white silk, indeterminable twist."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8a06d9e9-0d65-3341-88b2-85f7520f65ad/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8a06d9e9-0d65-3341-88b2-85f7520f65ad/dimension/1> ;
